  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 10.0.0.2-Beta-03 - 2026-09-22\n- Added VersionHeaderOperationFilter\n\n## 10.0.1.1-Beta-05 - 2026-08-31\n\n- Register `app-key` security scheme (`x-app-key` header); `ClientOpenApiDocumentFilter.CleanupSecuritySchemes` keeps it out of the spec unless a secure (\"api key\") endpoint references it\n\n## 10.0.1.1-Beta-04 - 2026-08-27\n\n- Remove x- prefix from api-key/app-key scheme reference \n\n## 10.0.1.1-Beta-03 - 2026-08-19\n\n- added RemoveOptionsOperationDocumentFilter\n\n## 10.0.1.1-Beta-02 - 2026-08-18\n\n- generate projectName swagger JSON files under the OpenApi folder\n\n## 10.0.1.1-Beta-01 - 2026-08-17\n\n- added ClientOpenApiDocumentFilter and implemented changes to handle multiple swagger json\n\n## 10.0.0.2-Beta-01 - 2026-08-27\n\n- Remove x- prefix from api-key/app-key scheme reference \n\n## 10.0.0.0-Beta-10 - 2026-07-20\n\n- handled null ref in OptionsOperationDocumentFilter",
